{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301110","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230111001:1":{"text":"안개가 바다를 뒤덮었을 때 톱니장어는 확실히 희귀했죠.","source_cn":"迷雾弥漫大海时，巨齿海鳗确实少见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD2155E69BB9DCF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230111002:1":{"text":"하지만 이제 안개가 걷히고 배들이 출항하면서 원양어도 그다지 희귀해지지 않게 되었어요.","source_cn":"不过随着迷雾消散，渔船出航，这类远海鱼在市场上已经不再稀缺。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF80C68AF827CE6E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230111003:1":{"text":"안개가 걷히기 전 가격으로 팔 수 있었으면 얼마나 좋았을까요?","source_cn":"要是它还能卖出迷雾消散前的价格，那该多好啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6660DC94969BB4E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:鱼贩海多克":{"text":"생선 장수 헤이독","source":"鱼贩海多克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}